description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-12-14T11:58:37Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T14:23:30Z","closed_at":"2026-02-06T14:23:30Z","assignee":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproduced in: v4.5.1.stable.steam [f62fdbde1]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable (f62fdbde1) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nXRCamera3D inherited from Camera3D, but it ignores most of the inherited value because it's supposed to be controlled by motion data.\nThe clipping distance properties `Near` and `Far` however, still work, as stated in [the Doc](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_xrcamera3d.html).\nEXCEPT. If there's a Camera3D in the scene and is set as \"current\", then the clipping distance is then determined by that Camera3D's property, despite the user is clearly using XRCamera3D to view the world.\n\nWhy would that be a problem? \nWell, I imported a scene I took online, not realizing it has a default camera in it, and I spent hours trying to figure out why everything gets clipped so easily, why does the valuew Doc said should work don't do anything.\nThe problem for me comes down to either:\n1. The XRCamera should be automatically marked as \"current\" since that's the camera Godot uses for all 3 viewports (Desktop, 2 eyes for VR headset).\n2. The Camera should behave based on its own property instead of other's.\n\nThat's about it.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Setup a XR enviroment with XROrigin and XRCamera3D\n2. Add enviroment, lighting and any mesh for camera to see\n3. Add a regular Camera3D and check \"Current\", set Near/Far to some random BS value\n4. Start VR, then see how XRCamera3D is broked despite its property is completely normal\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[xr-cam-problem.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24149585/xr-cam-problem.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114013/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}